OL,3,GNEWSAI find it quite demoralising in
OL,4,Astore - why I do all my shopping online
OL,5,
OL,6,FJess Bacon does all her clothes
OL,7,Fshopping online.
OL,9,FAs a plus-size woman, she finds the
OL,10,Fsize ranges available in stores
OL,11,Funreliable. "The sizing in store is
OL,12,Fnotoriously bad. I find it quite
OL,13,Fdemoralising in store," she says.
OL,15,F"The average size woman in the UK is a
OL,16,Fsize 14 or a size 16. I think a lot of
OL,17,Fpeople just don't feel seen or
OL,18,Frepresented," says the 29-year-old from
OL,19,FPeterborough.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
