OL,3,GNEWSAI find it quite demoralising in
OL,4,Astore - why I do all my shopping online
OL,5,
OL,6,FJess, a culture journalist and author,
OL,7,Ffinds shopping online "much quicker
OL,8,Fthan going into a store, paying for
OL,9,Fparking, trying things on".
